    <section class="reply section" id="rsvp"><div class="shell reply-grid"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">KONFIRMASI KEHADIRAN</span><h2>Temani kami di<br>hari <em>istimewa.</em></h2><p class="intro">Mohon beri kabar apakah Anda dapat hadir. Kami menantikan kebersamaan dengan Anda.</p><div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true">A <span>✦</span> E</div></div><div class="form-card reveal"><h3>RSVP</h3><p>Konfirmasi kehadiran Anda</p><form id="rsvp-form"><div class="field"><label for="rsvp-name">Nama tamu</label><input id="rsvp-name" name="name" type="text" minlength="2" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Nama lengkap Anda" required></div><fieldset><legend>Kehadiran</legend><div class="attendance"><label><input type="radio" name="attendance" value="yes" checked> Ya, saya hadir</label><label><input type="radio" name="attendance" value="no"> Maaf, tidak bisa hadir</label></div></fieldset><div class="field" id="guest-field"><label for="guest-count">Jumlah tamu yang hadir</label><select id="guest-count" name="guests"><option value="1">1 orang</option><option value="2">2 orang</option><option value="3">3 orang</option><option value="4">4 orang</option><option value="5">5 orang</option></select></div><button class="submit" type="submit">Kirim konfirmasi <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><p class="feedback" id="rsvp-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="local-note">Mode file lokal: konfirmasi hanya tersimpan di perangkat ini.</p></form></div></div></section>
